<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md> a djr:Document ;
    skos:prefLabel "implementation-django-web-final"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "# Django Web 구현 가이드"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2250, djr:R-2251 ;
    djr:text "\n\n> Django template, TemplateView/Generic CBV, web form, static asset, HTMX fragment, CSRF-aware AJAX, render acceptance check를 위한 전용 source reference다.\n> Django 모델, ORM, 마이그레이션, 트랜잭션, 서비스/셀렉터 일반 구현은 `implementation-django` 스킬이 소유한다.\n> REST API 계약과 Django Ninja 구현은 각각 `architecture-api`·`implementation-django-ninja` 스킬 기준을 따른다.\n>\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "> **출처 약어:**\n> - **[DDoc]** Django 공식 문서 (https://docs.djangoproject.com/)\n> - **[DDP]** Django Design Philosophies (https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/5.2/misc/design-philosophies/)\n> - **[DCS]** Django Coding Style (https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/dev/internals/contributing/writing-code/coding-style/)\n> - **[TSD]** Two Scoops of Django 3.x\n> - **[HS]** HackSoft Django Styleguide\n> - **[OWASP]** Django Security Cheat Sheet (https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Django_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html)\n> - **[HTMX]** htmx 공식 문서 (https://htmx.org/docs/)\n> - **[dddjango-django]** `implementation-django` 스킬 `references/final.md`\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 1. 책임 범위와 handoff"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2252, djr:R-2253 ;
    djr:text "\n`implementation-django-web`은 서버 렌더링 웹 화면 구현을 담당한다. 포함 범위는 TemplateView, Generic CBV/FBV 선택, templates, base template, includes/components, static files, CSS/JS, web forms, HTMX fragment, AJAX/HTMX CSRF, view auth/permission, render acceptance checks다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2261, djr:R-2262, djr:R-2263 ;
    djr:text "웹 view와 template은 domain behavior를 소유하지 않는다. view는 request handling, auth/permission, form/context orchestration, service/usecase 호출, response rendering을 조합한다. template은 presentation과 presentation-related branching만 담당한다. **[DDP] [dddjango-django]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2254 ;
    djr:text "다음 경우에는 다른 reference 또는 skill로 넘긴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1/b3> a djr:Block ;
