    djr:text "| REST resource, HTTP status, Problem Details, OpenAPI 계약 | architecture-api | 화면 fragment가 아니라 API 계약이 중심일 때 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1/b5> a djr:Block ;
